Error: managed Codex install not found at [CODEX_HOME]/packages/app-server-daemon/current/bin/codex

This command requires the install managed by the package manager, because the daemon starts app-server from that fixed path.

Install it with:
  npm install -g @reb.ai/codex

Then rerun the command you just tried.
To work without the background server, rerun the same command with --no-daemon (including resume or fork and its arguments).
